            <pentabarf:title>Kickoff + GOOD Plenary - &quot;So Far, So GOOD: Open OnDemand&#8217;s Journey and Future Direction&quot;</pentabarf:title>
            <pentabarf:subtitle></pentabarf:subtitle>
