            <summary>Kickoff + GOOD Plenary - &quot;So Far, So GOOD: Open OnDemand&#8217;s Journey and Future Direction&quot;</summary>
            <description>The GOOD Conference opens with a short kickoff session to welcome attendees, introduce the conference structure, and share key information to help everyone get oriented. The session includes brief remarks from Alan Chalker, who will reflect on the project&#8217;s evolution and looking ahead to the future of the Open OnDemand community.</description>
