            <pentabarf:title>Introduction to Appverse</pentabarf:title>
            <pentabarf:subtitle></pentabarf:subtitle>
            <pentabarf:language>en</pentabarf:language>
            <pentabarf:language-code>en</pentabarf:language-code>
            <dtstart>20260310T103000</dtstart>
            <dtend>20260310T105500</dtend>
            <duration>002500</duration>
            <summary>Introduction to Appverse</summary>
            <description>In this 25-minute session, we&#8217;ll share the vision behind the Appverse, how it works, current and future goals, and how centers and developers can contribute and benefit. Learn how the Appverse supports discoverability, reduces duplication of effort, and helps improve the overall user experience&#8212;while strengthening collaboration across institutions.</description>
