            <pentabarf:title>Auto Machine Learning on Open OnDemand</pentabarf:title>
            <pentabarf:subtitle></pentabarf:subtitle>
            <pentabarf:language>en</pentabarf:language>
            <pentabarf:language-code>en</pentabarf:language-code>
            <dtstart>20260311T165000</dtstart>
            <dtend>20260311T170000</dtend>
            <duration>001000</duration>
            <summary>Auto Machine Learning on Open OnDemand</summary>
            <description>The talk will start with a short introduction to Auto Machine Learning and its use cases. I will then provide a short demonstration of the application on the HPRC Launch cluster. Finally I will walk through the challenges of creating an interactive application like this.</description>
            <class>PUBLIC</class>
