            <summary>Open OnDemand Developer Team Open Mic</summary>
            <description>Last year at GOOD 25, the development team led essentially open mic sessions with the attendees on whatever questions or concerns they had in mind.  This led to incredible discussion and insight from things that ranged from applications to intricate security questions to requested features and to questions about how OOD is developed or designed.</description>
